    "CURRIMUS" : {

    },
    "Currimus reads your max heart rate and your resting heart rate from Apple Health every time it opens, and rebuilds the boundaries from them — fitness moves, and zones built on last year's numbers describe last year's runner. Max comes from the third-highest daily peak of the past year (one sensor glitch must not set your ceiling), resting from Health's own 60-day average." : {

    },
    "Currimus records your run as an Apple Health workout. Distance and heart rate come from there, so without access there is nothing to record." : {

